WEBVTT

00:00.440 --> 00:01.720
Wait until Your Majesty

00:01.800 --> 00:03.720
Hands over Xie Xuan, then he'll come

00:03.800 --> 00:05.760
By then no one can fault him

00:05.840 --> 00:07.240
Enough

00:10.240 --> 00:11.640
Order Zhu Yuanzhi

00:12.280 --> 00:13.680
To rescue the emperor

00:13.880 --> 00:15.280
Yes

00:22.000 --> 00:44.000
Not long after, the aristocratic alliance pointed their blades at the imperial city. Knowing well that no one would come to your rescue, you could only command your Great General to fight desperately to the end.

00:51.320 --> 00:53.040
The 21st year of Longwu

00:53.320 --> 00:54.800
Sikong Xu ascended the throne

00:54.880 --> 00:56.160
Changed era name to Changning

00:56.320 --> 00:58.200
Appointed Zhu Yuanzhi as Grand General

00:58.400 --> 01:00.400
Commander of all military affairs

01:00.520 --> 01:03.080
May enter court without bowing, addressed without name

01:03.160 --> 01:04.640
May enter court with sword and shoes

01:04.760 --> 01:06.680
Granted the nine bestowments and yellow battle-axe

01:06.800 --> 01:09.800
Opened a government office equal to the Three Excellencies

01:11.000 --> 01:20.000
Upon awakening, Zhu Yuanzhi sighed in gratitude: 'You fellows have certainly put me through immense hardship.'
